  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\nGiven: 8 D 14 A 2 C 3 B 9 = ?3\n\n8 D 14 A 2 C 3 B 9 = ? ⇒ 8 - 14 ÷ 2 + 3 × 9 = ?\n\n⇒ 8 - __**14 **____**÷**____** 2**__ + 3 × 9 = ?\n\n⇒ 8 - 7 + __**3 **____**×**____** 9**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**8 + 27**__ - 7 = ?\n\n⇒ __**35 - 7**__ = ?3\n\n⇒ 28 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
